			"notes": "- Minecarts are faster by default.\n- You can now change max speed with gamerules.\n- Added Pocket Minecart, it automatically picks up itself after leaving\n- Improved block collisions detection for minecarts of rails\n- Holding space (jump) in Minecarts will now stop them\n- Minecart Enchancer has been replaced by Minecart Configuration Tool. It allows to change physics, speed and braking ability per minecart\n- Added Configuring Rail Block, it can change everything Minecart Configuration Tool does, but automatically\n- Powered rails boost is now a constant value. You can change it with gamerules\n- Tweaked recipes"
		},
